  "result": "I've successfully implemented the payments system:\n\n**Created `src/payments.js`** with two functions:\n\n- `recordPayment(invoice, { amount, date })` \u2014 Records a payment on issued or partially_paid invoices. Returns `ok(newInvoice)` with the payment added to `invoice.payments`. Updates status to `'paid'` when fully covered, `'partially_paid'` when something is still owed.\n\n- `balanceDue(invoice)` \u2014 Returns the remaining amount owed (invoice total minus all payments).\n\n**Error handling:**\n- `NOT_ISSUED` \u2014 Payment can only be recorded on `'issued'` or `'partially_paid'` invoices\n- `AMOUNT_INVALID` \u2014 Amount must be a positive integer (in cents)\n- `OVERPAYMENT` \u2014 Payment exceeds the balance due\n\n**Updated `src/errors.js`** \u2014 Added the two new error codes with descriptions.\n\n**Added `test/payments.test.js`** \u2014 Comprehensive test suite covering:\n- Recording payments on issued invoices\n- Status transitions (draft \u2192 partially_paid \u2192 paid)\n- Validation of amount (zero, negative, fractional, overpayment)\n- Multiple payments\n- Balance due calculations\n- Immutability of input invoices\n\nAll 164 tests pass, including the 18 new payment tests.",
